Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.61,0:00:04.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们需要我们的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.17,0:00:16.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.32,0:00:37.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死  玛姬  我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Maggie, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:39.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先做个了结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not until it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.41,0:00:45.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手  不然她就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Or she's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.42,0:00:53.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把枪和刀子扔在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guns, knives on the ground right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.36,0:00:56.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外套不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.57,0:01:00.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对一个凶残的婊子来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a murderous bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.25,0:01:02.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们先把她衣服脱了  再开枪打死她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we'll take it off her before we shoot her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.04,0:01:19.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包扎的不对  我能感受到  没有止住\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't on there right, I can feel it. It ain't stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.46,0:01:20.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会弄紧的  天啊  给我点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting it tighter. Jesus, give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.00,0:01:22.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死  你切断了我的血液循环\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch, you're cutting off my circulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.96,0:01:24.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小伙子  本来就该这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sport, it's supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.82,0:01:26.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.71,0:01:32.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是普里莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Primo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.37,0:01:36.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死  他们抓到了他  给我对讲机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, they've got him. Give me the walkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.15,0:01:38.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babe, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.84,0:01:44.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下枪  混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower your gun, prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.07,0:01:48.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿着柯尔特蟒蛇左轮的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, with the colt python.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.28,0:01:51.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们所有人放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you, lower your weapons right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:03.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来吧  我们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on out. Let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.14,0:02:05.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.37,0:02:07.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到八个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.84,0:02:09.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.69,0:02:11.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们能干掉他们  我们杀过更多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we can take 'em. We took more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.15,0:02:18.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会出去  但我们会谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not coming out, but we will talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.84,0:02:19.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Names.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.06,0:02:22.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Names!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.50,0:02:23.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是玛姬  她是卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Maggie, she's Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.51,0:02:26.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔和玛姬在我们手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a Carol and a Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.18,0:02:29.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你们应该想谈谈这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking that's something you want to chat about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.17,0:02:34.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在就解决这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we're gonna work this out right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.62,0:02:36.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且要按我们的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's going to go our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.09,0:02:46.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以看见我们也抓了你们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see we have one of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.76,0:02:50.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.58,0:02:51.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.02,0:02:54.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先我想跟玛姬和卡萝尔讲话\N{\fnArial\fs30}First I want to talk to maggie and carol,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.67,0:02:56.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确保她们没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}make sure they're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.89,0:02:58.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来让你们通话  说自己没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna put you on. You say you're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.90,0:03:00.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们想耍花招  我会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll know if you try anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.62,0:03:03.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  我是卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, it's Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.25,0:03:05.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我没事  但  -该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm-- I'm fine, but-- - - Now you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.64,0:03:07.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  我是玛姬  我们都没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, it's Maggie. We're both okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.53,0:03:08.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们会搞定的  -闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll figure thi-- - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.41,0:03:11.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你信了  来谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have your proof. Let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.46,0:03:15.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  我们现在就交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the deal right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.29,0:03:19.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放走她们  你们可以得到自己的人并活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let 'em go, you can have your guy back and live.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.92,0:03:22.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个换一个  不公平啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two for one, that's not much of a trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.73,0:03:24.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have another choice
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.52,0:03:27.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然你们早就行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you would've done something about it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.24,0:03:30.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得救他回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.25,0:03:33.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,普里莫能照顾好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Primo can take care of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.72,0:03:35.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他能给我包扎伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can patch me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.39,0:03:38.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要他  拜这个婊子所赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need him, thanks to that bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.24,0:03:42.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你胆子哪去了  宝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost your balls, Paula.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.04,0:03:43.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该一枪爆了她的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've shot her in the head
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.39,0:03:44.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样他们就能听见她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they could hear her die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.32,0:03:46.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能不能把嘴闭上  我会解决这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you could just shut up, I'll solve this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.38,0:03:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么答应交易  要么冲进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then make the deal or we go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:49.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说了闭嘴  你就把嘴闭上\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said shut up, so shut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.87,0:03:51.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该庆幸她没有睾丸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be glad she doesn't have
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.35,0:03:53.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会被绊倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}a sack of gonads to trip over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.44,0:03:56.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你们在商量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know you're talking it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.46,0:03:57.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个交易很公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a fair trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.24,0:04:01.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来吧  我们换人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just come out, we do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.09,0:04:03.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后大家都能离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}we all walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.16,0:04:05.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自作聪明的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smug prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.56,0:04:07.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一定觉得我们是傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must think we're stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.29,0:04:09.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是件好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.93,0:04:11.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成交吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have a deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.36,0:04:16.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一会儿再和你联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.42,0:05:00.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.54,0:05:06.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.79,0:05:13.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,转弯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.15,0:05:21.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.74,0:05:29.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欧米伽  救世军伤亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Omega, Omega, Saviors down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.65,0:05:31.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,转到伽马  代号"火"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to Gamma, code "Fire."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.22,0:05:37.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿尔法频道不安全  我们按规定来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha channel is not clear. We follow the protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.67,0:05:41.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们死哪里去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.99,0:05:44.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在西边...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out west of the--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.83,0:05:47.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,15英里...\N{\fnArial\fs30}15 mi-- on-- way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.81,0:05:49.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们正在前往断点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're headed to the break point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,转到西塔频道  代号不变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switch to Theta channel, same code.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.84,0:05:54.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如我没到  切换到阿尔法  进行监听\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm not there, toggle to Alpha, listen in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.44,0:05:55.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.55,0:06:03.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌这个鬼地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate this damn place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.04,0:06:05.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安全屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.43,0:06:06.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(屠宰间  生肉处理)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.16,0:06:07.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方没什么安全可言\N{\fnArial\fs30}There ain't nothing safe about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.88,0:06:10.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方会救我们一命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is gonna save our asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.83,0:06:26.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐地上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.92,0:06:28.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你  这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}You there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.90,0:06:36.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你  那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.59,0:07:00.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们一定在想有没有办法脱身\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wondering if there's a way out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.17,0:07:04.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  除非我开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't. Not unless I say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.24,0:07:22.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝拉  我需要支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paula, I need backup!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.15,0:07:28.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想马上就杀了你俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to kill you both right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.28,0:07:29.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好不容易才忍住不下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's taking all I have not to,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:32.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你们敢动动心思试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}so go ahead, I dare you, try something. Just see what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.47,0:08:55.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上一次来人检查这里是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When's the last time anyone checked this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.48,0:08:56.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个月前这里还是好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was fine a month ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.90,0:08:58.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甜心  那可是一个月前啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetie, that was a month ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.34,0:08:59.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况变坏得很快的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit hards quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.55,0:09:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪没了  食物也没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guns have gone bye-bye, the food's gone bye-bye,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.00,0:09:04.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过道里前前后后都是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we got growlers up and down the halls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.21,0:09:06.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说明人也可以穿过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means people can get through, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.27,0:09:07.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-也许我们该走了  -卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe we should get gone. - Carol!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.43,0:09:09.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是吗  去哪里  -哪里也不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? Where the hell to? - Nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.53,0:09:11.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过道里有行尸  正好是免费保安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got dead in the halls? Free security.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.04,0:09:14.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果那些混蛋比我们的人先到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those assholes get here before our people,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.66,0:09:16.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些行尸能帮我们拖延一点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}the cold bloods will buy us some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.99,0:09:18.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.41,0:09:20.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  还在流血  应该止住了才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, it's bleeding. It's not supposed to keep bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.34,0:09:22.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-老莫  把绳子给我  -我不能死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Molly, give me the rope. - I'm not losing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.31,0:09:25.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我不能  -你撑着点  天啊  唐尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not. - So you grind it out. Jesus, Donnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.75,0:09:28.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的  雪儿  得把他换回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you, 'chelle! We have to get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.83,0:09:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他能包扎好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.92,0:09:32.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们必须这么做  宝拉  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to, Paula. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.05,0:09:34.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到他们了  而你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw them, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.89,0:09:36.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们占领了那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took the place down,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.38,0:09:38.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还拿了枪  他们会杀了我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got the guns, they'll kill us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.39,0:09:40.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会轻易认命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going down like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.59,0:09:42.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟都撑到现在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not after making it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.27,0:09:50.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.55,0:09:54.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她喘不上气了  快把她的口松开\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's hyperventilating. Somebody needs to take her gag off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.54,0:10:04.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她真是个胆小鬼  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a nervous little bird, ain't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.36,0:10:12.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.29,0:10:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这婊子是怎么活到现在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch, how did you make it this far?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.91,0:10:20.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  你现在要深呼吸  冷静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, you need to take some yoga breaths and calm your ass down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.17,0:10:22.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.73,0:10:40.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是那种人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.16,0:10:57.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在怕什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you so afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.35,0:11:05.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的怕死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you actually afraid to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.22,0:11:13.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事到如今  你还怕吃枪子儿不成\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this and you're scared of getting your ticket punched.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.20,0:11:19.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是死是活不要紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter what happens to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.45,0:11:24.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请别伤害玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't hurt Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.53,0:11:26.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别伤害孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hurt the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.33,0:11:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.74,0:11:44.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是怀孕了  但看着不像\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got a bun in the oven, she doesn't look it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.76,0:11:46.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该才两个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm only two months, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.19,0:11:50.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也真是蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're some kind of stupid,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.58,0:11:52.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这年头还被人搞大肚子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting knocked up at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.37,0:11:54.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得好笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that's funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.51,0:11:57.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那什么时候怀孕不算蠢呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was it ever smart to get knocked up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.08,0:12:01.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前的女人还难产致死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Women used to just die in childbirth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.25,0:12:04.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们总觉得世界要毁灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they always thought the world was gonna end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.67,0:12:07.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再怎样都要挺过去  干嘛放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Living through it, why would you just give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.49,0:12:09.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你真觉得你会挺过去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But are you gonna live through it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.12,0:12:14.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, that's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.32,0:12:17.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子才是重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babies are the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.49,0:12:19.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子是我们的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Children are our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.69,0:12:24.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给行尸当小点心还差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making bite-size snacks for the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.31,0:12:29.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重点是有口气站着\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point is to stay standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.35,0:12:31.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.31,0:12:33.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行尸也能站着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walkers do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.02,0:12:36.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做出了自己的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm choosing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.94,0:12:39.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.30,0:12:42.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你选了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.11,0:12:44.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.14,0:13:09.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.98,0:13:21.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  你还没弄明白吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, in case you haven't noticed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.39,0:13:24.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你遇到的问题比二手烟大得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got bigger problems than a little secondhand smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.74,0:13:28.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.64,0:13:37.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们比一群福音派的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all are worse than a bunch
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.98,0:13:40.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二年级小学生还让人头疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}of evangelical second graders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.53,0:13:55.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那东西会害死你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those things'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.47,0:13:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经要被害死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是活死人罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a dead woman walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:07.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这意味着我们是同一条船上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}which puts us in exactly the same boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.06,0:14:28.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的手臂好疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}My arm feels like it's on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.02,0:14:28.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把那个扯掉 \N{\fnArial\fs30}You pull that off,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:30.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伤口就会像水龙头一样血流如注\N{\fnArial\fs30}you gonna be nothing but a spigot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.41,0:14:31.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.06,0:14:36.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,侦察队马上就来  最多等半小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scout crew is coming. They're 30 minutes out, maybe less.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.83,0:14:38.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他等不了半小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't have 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.58,0:14:41.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的神经要坏死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His nerves are dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.36,0:14:44.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果没有救治  他就会失去一只手\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he doesn't get medical help, he's gonna lose his arm,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.49,0:14:45.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至丢了性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.85,0:14:49.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我虽然不是医生  但我爸失去了一条腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a doctor, but my dad lost his leg,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.67,0:14:51.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我至少知道这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I know that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.74,0:14:59.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的人  普里莫  你认为他能帮你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your man, Primo, you think he can help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.86,0:15:04.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该结束这一切了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.39,0:15:06.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联系瑞克吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.50,0:15:11.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等半小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.20,0:15:27.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我有什么不满吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know my problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.24,0:15:35.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是她把我打成这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.28,0:15:39.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她一手造成的  现在却坐在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did it and she's just sitting there
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.07,0:15:41.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-安然无恙  毫发无伤  -T\N{\fnArial\fs30}- right as rain, fully intact. - T
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.45,0:15:43.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不要交换人质了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not gonna make the trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.49,0:15:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在就把她们杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we just do 'em both now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.91,0:15:50.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行  我们要等其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we wait for the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.50,0:15:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能犯傻  我们需要有保险措施\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to be smart. We need insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.20,0:15:56.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那就对她的胳膊也开一枪  -不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then shoot her in the arm, too.- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.17,0:16:01.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真要护着这个胆小的贱人  而不顾我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really gonna stick up for some gutless bitch over me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.74,0:16:07.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-该死  -闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God damn it! - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:09.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别逼我  宝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't push me, Paula.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.04,0:16:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.97,0:16:20.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别碰她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave her alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.68,0:16:26.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.69,0:16:29.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这愚蠢  嚣张的贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dumb, uppity bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.04,0:16:46.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确实挺蠢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really are some kind of stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:52.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把她带出去  看她是否知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her out. See if she knows anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.96,0:16:54.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前就该这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should've done that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.07,0:17:02.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.12,0:17:21.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有不错的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got nice clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.65,0:17:24.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时间造人\N{\fnArial\fs30}time to make babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:27.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们躲在一个生活条件不错的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're holed up somewhere good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.61,0:17:30.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me where.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.64,0:17:50.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别拖时间了  贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't draw this out, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.93,0:17:52.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me where.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.86,0:17:57.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就当帮帮你自己  和你肚子里的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help yourself and the baby in your belly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.57,0:18:01.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想活命  就得给我们带来好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way you stay alive is you produce for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.53,0:18:08.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们并不是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.20,0:18:11.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该知道这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.56,0:18:17.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他打得真狠  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got you good, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.43,0:18:19.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他处于疼痛中\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.04,0:18:20.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男人耐痛能力差\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys can't handle pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.74,0:18:26.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打扰下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.68,0:18:31.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想道句谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wanted to say thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.08,0:18:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢你们帮了玛姬和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}for helping Maggie, for helping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.34,0:18:40.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我丈夫艾迪  他以前常常...  -是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My husband Ed, he used to... - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.12,0:18:44.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不关心你丈夫以前是否虐待过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care if your old man used to ring your bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.27,0:18:49.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很清楚你是什么样的人  卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see exactly who you are, Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.06,0:18:52.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.32,0:18:54.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.62,0:18:57.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想觉得我们是一类人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna think we're just the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.84,0:18:58.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管这么想好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:19:00.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.80,0:19:03.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只是个给我暖床的罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just a warm body for my bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.72,0:19:07.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仅此而已  我可以在他睡梦中杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. I could kill him in his sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.08,0:19:26.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的信那个鬼东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really believe in that crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:35.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的信仰帮我度过了丧女之痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}My faith got me through the death of my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.82,0:19:40.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好消息是也许很快你又能见到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the good news is maybe you'll see her again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.81,0:19:51.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的手怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.47,0:19:55.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偷东西  被抓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stole something. Got caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.62,0:19:58.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偷什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.68,0:20:02.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,汽油  就从这里偷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gas, from this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.19,0:20:04.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么  -为了找一辆新车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - To get a new car.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.98,0:20:06.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去找我男朋友的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look for my boyfriend's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.41,0:20:10.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.16,0:20:12.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他被炸死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was blown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.89,0:20:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没剩下什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.17,0:20:22.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Frankie."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.09,0:20:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是他的名字吗  -当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Was that his name? - Hell, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:29.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我几乎不了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I barely knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.94,0:20:31.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.58,0:20:38.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗兰克是我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank was my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.50,0:20:43.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也曾想给我孩子取这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's what I was gonna name the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.33,0:20:51.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我很遗憾  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.62,0:20:56.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才不遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}You aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.37,0:21:00.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我今天不想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not planning to die today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.39,0:21:02.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我也不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.09,0:21:07.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是  我们中有一个人错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thing is, one of us is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.97,0:21:14.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me where.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.30,0:21:31.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想过了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you thought about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.00,0:21:34.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.02,0:21:39.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你之前没好好听\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.98,0:21:42.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说我会联系你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I'd contact you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.34,0:21:46.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我说我很抱歉  事情会有转机吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would it make a difference if I said I was sorry about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.89,0:21:48.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.70,0:21:51.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为我们可以交换人质\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're gonna make the trade,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.26,0:21:53.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}so tell me where.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.44,0:21:58.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还没有同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't agreed to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.06,0:22:00.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.73,0:22:04.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  我可不敢保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.11,0:22:08.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大部分的风险都在我们这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd be taking most of the risk,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.63,0:22:11.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却得不到太多的回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}not getting much in the way of a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.05,0:22:15.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另一个选择对你们而言是行不通的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other option won't work out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.36,0:22:21.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们愿意冒险一试\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take our chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.72,0:22:33.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不用这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.01,0:22:33.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不用抗争的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.86,0:22:37.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的人杀了我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your people killed all of my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.72,0:22:38.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们当然要抗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course we gotta fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.74,0:22:42.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们不想的  -但你们做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We didn't want to. - But you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.47,0:22:44.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tell me why.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.23,0:22:49.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的人在公路上伏击我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your people ambushed my people on the road,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.47,0:22:52.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想抢走我们的一切东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}tried to take everything we had.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.06,0:22:57.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想杀了我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were gonna kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.81,0:23:00.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.52,0:23:05.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们知道T的小队出了什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now we know what happened to T's group.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.14,0:23:07.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那群白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.22,0:23:12.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-当时估计很招摇  -好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Probably put on a big show. - Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.75,0:23:14.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,合情合理\N{\fnArial\fs30}fair play.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.53,0:23:18.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是正当防卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were just defending yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.70,0:23:21.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, see,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.81,0:23:25.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的人在公路上杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}your people killed them on the road, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.92,0:23:27.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他们炸成碎片了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blew them to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.93,0:23:30.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么还不停手\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why not stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.79,0:23:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说他们是尼根的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said they were working for Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.59,0:23:42.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对尼根了解些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do you think you know about Negan?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.68,0:23:46.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他听起来像个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sounded like a maniac.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.79,0:23:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都很害怕  觉得有必要阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were scared. We had to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.30,0:23:50.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetie, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.36,0:23:53.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are all Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.34,0:23:58.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.80,0:24:05.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这话什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.88,0:24:29.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能给我来根吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I have one?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.59,0:24:32.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看你  胆小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at you, little bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.83,0:24:36.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你不赞同抽烟呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think you approved.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.14,0:24:38.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是不赞同\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.27,0:25:02.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确实很弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.00,0:25:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在怕什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you so afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.66,0:25:12.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怕到都无法坚守自己的原则了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So scared, you can't even stick to your own principles.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.99,0:25:18.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会想让我坚守我的原则的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want me to stick to my own principles.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.57,0:25:32.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前是个秘书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a secretary before.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.01,0:25:38.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给老板端咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fetched coffee for my boss
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.78,0:25:42.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他自我感觉良好\N{\fnArial\fs30}and made him feel good about himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.40,0:25:43.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我大多数时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent most of my days reading
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.99,0:25:46.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都在读弱智的励志邮件\N{\fnArial\fs30}stupid inspirational e-mails
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.54,0:25:48.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试图让自己感觉好点\N{\fnArial\fs30}to try and feel good about myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.20,0:25:52.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有这么一个流传很广的邮件\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was this one that kept going around.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.83,0:25:55.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个年轻的女人遇到了困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}A young woman was having a hard time
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.93,0:25:58.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟她妈妈说她想放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}and told her mom she wanted to give up,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.93,0:26:00.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她妈妈走进了厨房\N{\fnArial\fs30}so her mom went to the kitchen
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.29,0:26:03.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始烧三壶水\N{\fnArial\fs30}and started boiling three pots of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.18,0:26:06.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一壶放了根胡萝卜  一壶放了颗鸡蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}She put a carrot in one, an egg in another,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.62,0:26:09.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后一壶放了咖啡豆\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ground coffee beans in the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.33,0:26:12.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,煮了一会后  她妈妈说\N{\fnArial\fs30}After they had boiled a while, her mom said,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.59,0:26:16.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"看  这三样东西都放水里煮过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Look, all three things went through the same boiling water.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.54,0:26:19.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萝卜放进去之前很硬  煮完后变软了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The carrot went in strong and came out soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.90,0:26:22.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鸡蛋本来很脆弱  但煮完后变硬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The egg was fragile and came out hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.80,0:26:26.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然而咖啡豆却改变了水"\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the coffee beans changed the water itself."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.74,0:26:33.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该想成为咖啡豆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to want to be the coffee beans.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.10,0:26:39.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  咖啡对我而言只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, to me, coffee was just a thing
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.40,0:26:41.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我老板会喝光的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my boss would drink up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.07,0:26:43.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管我给他续杯多少次\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how many times I refilled his damn cup,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.37,0:26:45.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他总是能喝完\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was just never enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.91,0:26:53.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,军队接手华盛顿的时候我在上班\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was at work when the Army took over DC.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.69,0:26:56.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不准我们离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We weren't allowed to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.94,0:27:00.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们首先得让所有重要人士撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had to evacuate all the important people first--
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.24,0:27:03.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国会成员  政府员工\N{\fnArial\fs30}members of Congress, government employees.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.18,0:27:06.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我和我的上司待在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I was stuck with my boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.18,0:27:08.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而不是我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not my family--
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.55,0:27:14.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的丈夫  我的四个女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}my husband, my four girls...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.56,0:27:28.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的上司又笨又弱  他会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My boss was weak and stupid and he was going to die
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.22,0:27:30.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还会拖累我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he was going to take me down, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.78,0:27:32.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是我杀的第一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was the first person I killed
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.81,0:27:35.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样我才能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that I could live.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.80,0:27:40.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我杀了十几个人后就不数了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stopped counting when I hit double digits.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.11,0:27:42.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从那以后我也没有愧疚感了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right around the time I stopped feeling bad about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.22,0:27:46.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不像你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.70,0:27:52.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我仍是我  但是更好的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still me, but better.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.52,0:27:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我抛弃了一切  这让我更强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost everything and it made me stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.07,0:27:57.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.72,0:27:59.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.63,0:28:01.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟那些人  那些凶手一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}With those people, those killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.95,0:28:04.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的人也是凶手  卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your people are killers, Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.86,0:28:06.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说明你也是一名凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes you a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.17,0:28:22.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你...你才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You-- you're the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.06,0:28:23.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.68,0:28:25.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才是怕死的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who's afraid to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.75,0:28:28.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且你还是会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're going to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.89,0:28:32.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.95,0:28:37.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不解决这件事  你就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what's gonna happen if you don't work this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.12,0:28:42.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会杀了我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.89,0:28:47.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.13,0:28:58.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋  你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asshole, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.75,0:29:02.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.02,0:29:07.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们考虑过了  我们想交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've thought about it. We want to make the trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.51,0:29:09.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.70,0:29:14.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I-66公路外两英里的地方有一块空地\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a large field with a sign that says "God is dead"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.51,0:29:17.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面有个标识牌写着"上帝已死"\N{\fnArial\fs30}about two miles down I-66.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.70,0:29:19.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各个方向的视野都很开阔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good visibility in all directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.44,0:29:23.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们十分钟后在那里见怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll meet you there. 10 minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.93,0:29:26.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.85,0:29:32.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对  这也太简单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-mm. Now, that was too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.61,0:29:35.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他们只是太想把他们的人救回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they're just itching to get their people back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.89,0:29:38.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  没有静电噪音  应该有噪音的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there was no static. There should've been static.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.03,0:29:39.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们离这里很近  说不定已经到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're close. They're probably already here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.98,0:29:41.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们很小心  但还是会留下踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were careful, but there were tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.82,0:29:43.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-肯定会有的  -不...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There had to be. - No...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.18,0:29:45.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们杀了家里的所有人  他们有武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}They killed everybody back home. They have the weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.46,0:29:46.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们很清楚自己在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know what they're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.35,0:29:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们可能想等我们一走出门\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're probably waiting to kill us
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.30,0:29:49.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就杀了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}as soon as we walk out those doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.81,0:29:51.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-换我们就会这么做  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's what we'd do. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.80,0:29:56.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得听我说  求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to listen to me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.96,0:30:00.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克是信守承诺的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick is a man of his word.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.97,0:30:03.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不会拿我和玛姬的生命冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't put me and Maggie at risk to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.67,0:30:06.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他就和你们一样蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he's just as stupid as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.30,0:30:10.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么时候到\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your ETA?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.03,0:30:12.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有几分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few minutes away,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.43,0:30:14.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-但车子没油了  -我们有油\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but the car is running on fumes. - We have gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.84,0:30:17.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们给你加满油  然后出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll fill you up and then we move.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.02,0:30:19.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快到的时候呼叫我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radio when you're back in the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.07,0:30:21.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.99,0:30:23.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.64,0:30:26.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫上雪儿  别让她陷入战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull 'Chelle out so she doesn't get stuck in a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.04,0:30:28.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要准备好随时出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to be ready to move at any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.93,0:30:30.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个姑娘怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.32,0:30:33.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave her for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.58,0:30:36.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要离开这  就得轻装上阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we leave, we travel light.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.36,0:30:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果那帮混蛋来了  就在门口干掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if the pricks are here, we pick 'em off at the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.46,0:30:52.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老莫  我们得把这条过道清空\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molls, we need this hall clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.87,0:31:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别着急  甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a sec, sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.19,0:32:05.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.00,0:32:07.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.37,0:32:10.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们散开了  但我觉得我们能溜出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've spread out, but I think we can make it past them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.54,0:32:12.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们必须试一下  -我们不能留活口\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to try. - We can't leave them alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.23,0:32:14.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们应该直接走\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we should just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.14,0:32:16.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔  我们得做个了结  必须这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol, we have to finish this. We have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.75,0:33:05.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.60,0:33:09.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他要尸变了  -我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's turning. - We should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.31,0:33:12.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.42,0:33:15.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.93,0:33:47.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃屎去死吧  唐尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat shit and die, Donnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.81,0:33:50.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪呢  美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are ya, Magnolia?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.74,0:33:54.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要割开你那漂亮的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna bloody up that nice--
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.06,0:34:09.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.54,0:34:56.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们用行尸来防止我们逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're using them to keep us in,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.91,0:34:58.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阻拦其他人进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep the others out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.57,0:35:02.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.58,0:35:04.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得找到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to find 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.67,0:35:20.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just run.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.31,0:35:22.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打死她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.98,0:35:26.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.57,0:35:30.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了唐尼  你杀了莫莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've killed Donnie, you've killed Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.75,0:35:34.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的人毁了我的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your people have destroyed my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.62,0:35:36.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-离开这  -卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get outta here. - Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.38,0:35:38.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你根本不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.80,0:35:40.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The things I've done,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.70,0:35:43.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我放弃了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what I've given up,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.83,0:35:45.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不得不做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what I had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.77,0:35:48.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-走吧  -卡萝尔  打死她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just run. - Carol, shoot her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.80,0:35:51.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开枪吧  我已经一无所有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. I've already lost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.08,0:35:57.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paula?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.51,0:35:59.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paula?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.24,0:36:03.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.25,0:36:16.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个撒谎的贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lying bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.91,0:36:37.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.43,0:36:43.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厉害啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.09,0:36:47.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胆小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nervous little bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.09,0:36:50.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你曾经是那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.90,0:36:56.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你现在已经不是了  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.25,0:37:00.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.13,0:37:03.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过让你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.37,0:37:07.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然你本事这么大\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you could do all this,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.77,0:37:11.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你到底怕的是什么  卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}what were you so afraid of, Carol?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.64,0:37:26.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怕这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was afraid of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.66,0:37:58.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝拉  我们接近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paula, we're approaching the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.47,0:37:59.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能进去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we a go?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.51,0:38:12.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.39,0:38:24.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在屠宰间见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet us on the kill floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.95,0:38:31.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我可能杀了18个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I might have killed 18 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.03,0:38:34.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,20个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}20.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.37,0:38:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也应该在树林里杀了唐尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've killed Donnie, too, in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.00,0:38:42.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全能打中  我故意打偏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a clear shot. I didn't miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.17,0:38:48.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我杀了他  这一切就不会发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of this would've happened if I had just killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.24,0:38:52.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-别想了  -我停不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't think about it. - I can't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.43,0:38:54.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.28,0:39:14.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当心  地板很滑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful. The floor's slick.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.13,0:39:16.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定是这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure this is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.97,0:39:18.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说是屠宰间\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said kill floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.57,0:39:23.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这门锁住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, this one's locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.45,0:39:30.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?! Agh!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.45,0:40:44.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.46,0:40:46.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.90,0:40:48.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们发现了你们的踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got your trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.09,0:40:51.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你点火了吗  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You start a fire? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.04,0:40:53.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you good?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.69,0:40:56.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.16,0:40:57.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.29,0:41:02.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们死了  抓我们的人都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dead. They're all dead, the ones that took us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.42,0:41:03.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.34,0:41:06.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.22,0:41:09.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.58,0:41:12.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做不下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.47,0:41:14.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.14,0:41:16.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的朋友们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friends are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.28,0:41:18.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人来救你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's coming for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.03,0:41:21.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你最好开口吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you might as well talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.57,0:41:22.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烧死他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.50,0:41:26.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我问你最后一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna ask you one last time...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.30,0:41:29.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩托是哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}how'd you get the bike?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.15,0:41:32.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是我们找到的  -放屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We found it. - Like hell you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.14,0:41:33.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我们找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.09,0:41:34.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根昨晚在那栋楼里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was Negan in that building last night
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.71,0:41:36.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是说他在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}or was he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.35,0:41:43.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.91,0:41:47.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是尼根  蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Negan, shithead.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.65,0:41:52.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以谈很多有趣的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a whole world of fun that we can talk about,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.76,0:41:53.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就谈谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so let's have a chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.74,0:41:54.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉变成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry it had to come to this.
